          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, cu Jɔ-cua ro̱l ka̱n kɛɛliwdɛ, cuɛ jɛ go̱k pëkni diaal, pëk päämni kɛ pëk in cɔal i̱ Nɛ-gɛb, kɛ täp wec diaal kɛnɛ thär päämnikɛ amäni kua̱rkiɛn, kä /ke̱rɛ kɛ pa̱l rue̱y, cuɛ tin diaal tin tëk rɛydiɛn nor, nikɛ mëë ci Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ lar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä Ka-dɛc-bar-ni-ya amäni Gadha amäni rɛy rööl Go-cɛn kɛɛliw wä amäni Gib-yon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jɔ-cua kua̱r ti̱ti̱ diaal käp wi̱cdiɛn kɛ gua̱a̱th kɛl, kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl nɛɛkɛ lua̱k thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔrɛ cu Jɔ-cua kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal loc wi̱cdiɛn kä Gil-gal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.43"
            ]
          }
        }
